hods in surveys of diseases of the nervous system</article-title><source>Journal of Neurology, Neurosurgery and Psychiatry</source><year>1998</year><volume>64</volume><fpage>2</fpage><lpage>3</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/jnnp.64.1.2</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Forbes</surname><given-names>RB</given-names></name><name><surname>Swingler</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Estimating the prevalence of multiple sclerosis in the United Kingdom by using capture-recapture methodology</article-title><source>American Journal of Epidemiology</source><year>1999</year><volume>149</volume><fpage>1016</fpage><lpage>24</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10355377</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>